{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>韓籍啦啦隊女神李多慧近日趁工作空檔快閃香港旅遊，期間罕有改頭換面以全新破格造型現身街頭。她不僅以一身性感裝扮大曬零贅肉螞蟻腰，更罕有露出平時極少見身體部位。這輯夜遊香港街頭打卡照曝光後瞬間吸引逾7.2萬人朝聖，令人完全認不出照片中人。</p>\n<h2>李多慧快閃香港展現極致成熟魅力</h2>\n<p>李多慧日前抵達香港四處遊玩打卡，從黃昏一路拍攝到繁華夜景之中。她在街頭捨棄了一貫甜美打扮，換上一襲酒紅色短身背心並配搭同色系外套，隨性半露香肩之餘更完美展現出緊實馬甲線與纖幼螞蟻腰。下半身配搭黑色長裙並戴上銀框太陽眼鏡，在五光十色霓虹燈光影交織下散發出陣陣冷艷氣場，整個畫面充滿濃厚電影感。</p>\n<h2>親自發布夜遊照片派福利引發轟動</h2>\n<p>即使平時工作行程滿檔，李多慧依然非常用心經營社交平台並積極與粉絲互動。她前日親自將這批極具風格香港街頭遊玩照片上載至個人Instagram帳號與大眾分享。相片不僅紀錄了她於香港大街小巷穿梭愉快時光，更將她有別於過往形象成熟一面完全展露人前，迅速吸引大量網民湧入點讚及熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2>李多慧告別招牌空氣劉海露精緻V臉</h2>\n<p>過去赴台發展3年期間，李多慧絕大部分時間皆以柔順長直髮配搭韓式空氣劉海作為個人標誌亮相。這回她卻罕有大膽改變造型，將一頭長髮俐落整齊地向後紮起，完全告別招牌劉海並徹底露出光潔額頭。這個全新髮型令她極致精緻五官與V字鵝蛋臉毫無保留地呈現出來，不但帶來強烈視覺反差，更為整體觀感增添幾分清爽與利落。</p>\n<h2>大批網民震驚留言狂讚女神判若兩人</h2>\n<p>破格靚相曝光後短短時間內便極速累積逾7.2萬個讚好，大批粉絲湧入留言區洗版式狂讚。不少人對於其氣質變化感到驚艷，紛紛激動留言表示「多慧這髮型簡直換了一個人，但一樣好可愛啊」、「好不一樣的多慧」以及「到哪都像在拍廣告，太美了我的公主」。更有網民高度評價她這次蛻變，直指「這妝髮很有港星感覺」，認為她無論轉換任何風格都能夠完美駕馭。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550559928447049_2344701796b053dc0df84d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"le_dahye_1795267160_4035315353792968723_642221341.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550559928447049_2344701796b053dc0df84d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550560452555583_15198261296b053dc50abde.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"le_dahye_1795267160_4035315357559455946_642221341.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550560452555583_15198261296b053dc50abde.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/saveclip.app_484873290_18494106028045342_8070109567903030075_n_146874013167dd4283580c4-1024x1279.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"李多慧 （圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/saveclip.app_484873290_18494106028045342_8070109567903030075_n_146874013167dd4283580c4-1024x1279.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550560720374697_14707581736b053dc7b19fa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"李多慧 （圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550560720374697_14707581736b053dc7b19fa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550560873267599_5379632796b053dc943439.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"le_dahye_1795267160_4035315316874661575_642221341.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550560873267599_5379632796b053dc943439.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T07:43:57.639039+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1090,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:33:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T08:57:22.351116+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:37:24.603193+00:00","content_hash":"547d5e594adc51255b755fa6e2d981093ed53eb6a4dd81902c1fda3797d40373","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}